        notes: 'Verified against TWOIAF, The Targaryen Kings section (Daeron II). This is Princess Daenerys, sister of Daeron II, who married Prince Maron Martell to bring Dorne into the realm. Source text: one of his earliest significant acts after assuming the throne was to begin negotiations with his good-brother, Prince Maron, to unify Dorne under Targaryen rule... Prince Maron agreed to be betrothed to Daeron''s sister, Daenerys, once she was of age.'
